# isyncrc

## Account1
IMAPAccount account1
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User 3218243471m@gmail.com
PassCmd "~/.config/aerc/mutt_oauth2.py --decryption-pipe 'gpg --decrypt' ~/.config/aerc/refresh_token/account1"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs XOAUTH2

IMAPStore account1-remote
Account account1

MaildirStore account1-local
Path ~/doc/mail/account1/
Inbox ~/doc/mail/account1/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel account1
Far :account1-remote:
Near :account1-local:
Patterns *
Expunge both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Sync All
Create Near
SyncState *

